* corpus sequence: OBJPOS mode 14 on both gripper pairs, then GENAXS 7 15 15. OBJPOS 14 leaves the spring value (obj+0x2588) at 0, so no spring reset; it closes pair 4/5 by -u and GENAXS opens it again by u (result = seed to ~1e-10); record (6 7 -90 -80) (corrected after oracle run; spring reset: see v_spring)
KFREAD 0
_TEMP_STEP.KEY
OBJPOS	4	14	5	0	1e-05	1
OBJPOS	6	14	7	0	1e-05	1
GENAXS 7 15 15
KFWRIT
OUT.KEY
